      "kind": "TRANSACTION_BATCH_COVERAGE",
      "text": "Offline batch alignment=ALIGNED; old VK cell covered=True; dirty page matches the later slot=True.",
      "text_zh": "离线事务批次对齐状态=ALIGNED；旧 VK cell 是否被脏页覆盖=True；脏页内容是否与后续槽位一致=True。"
    }
  ],
  "limitations": [
    {
      "text": "Cell RVAs are comparable only if the later hive was not reorganized (Windows 8+ hive reorganization can move cells).",
      "text_zh": "只有当后续 hive 没有被重新组织时，cell RVA 才可直接比较；Windows 8+ 的 hive 重组会移动 cell。"
    },
    {
      "text": "A free cell proves storage release, not who or what requested the deletion; free-cell residue may also be stale.",
      "text_zh": "空闲 cell 只能证明存储被释放，不能证明是谁或什么操作发起删除；空闲 cell 中的残留字节也可能来自更早的内容。"
    },
    {
      "text": "Absence from a parsed hive is not proof that a value never existed; it may be a collection, scope, or acquisition gap.",
      "text_zh": "解析后的 hive 中不存在某个值，不等于该值从未存在；也可能是采集范围、快照时点或获取过程造成的缺口。"
    },
    {
      "text": "New-format transaction logs contain dirty page images and sequence numbers, not semantic operation names or actor identities.",
      "text_zh": "新格式事务日志保存的是脏页映像和序号，不包含语义化的操作名称、进程、用户或操作者身份。"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reallocation proves that the old slot start was overwritten or reused by the later state; it does not prove that a free state existed between the two snapshots.",
      "text_zh": "槽位再分配只能证明后续状态覆盖或复用了旧槽位起始位置，不能证明两份快照之间一定出现过可观察的空闲状态。"
    }
  ],
  "missing_evidence": [
    {
      "code": "INTERMEDIATE_FREE_STATE",
      "description": "A snapshot or transaction batch showing the old VK slot free before a different item occupies it.",
      "description_zh": "需要一份中间快照或事务批次，显示旧 VK 槽位在另一个配置项占用它之前确实处于空闲状态。"
    },
    {
      "code": "DELETION_TRANSACTION_OR_AUDIT_EVENT",
      "description": "A transaction/audit record tying the disappearance to a specific operation, time, and actor.",
      "description_zh": "需要能把消失过程绑定到具体操作、时间和操作者的事务记录、审计日志、EDR 或部署工具日志。"
    },
    {
      "code": "FULL_DISK_PROVENANCE",
      "description": "Acquisition hashes, device/image identifiers, and a documented chain of custody for both hive snapshots.",
      "description_zh": "需要两份 hive 快照的采集哈希、设备/镜像标识和完整的证据保管链记录。"
    }
